---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p>Hello world! I like:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Discovering that a difficult theorem is actually trivial</li>
      <li>Tuning my piano and playing it</li>
      <li>Everything written by Chopin</li>
      <li>Watching chess grandmasters lose to computers</li>
      <li>Internet forums and written discussions</li>
      <li>Finding patterns that nobody has noticed before</li>
      <li>Discovering contradictions in social norms</li>
      <li>Project Euler</li>
      <li>C++</li>
      <li>Software that starts instantly</li>
      <li>Being able to understand everyone in a conversation</li>
    </ul>
    I dislike:
    <ul>
      <li>Mosquitoes</li>
      <li>Traveling</li>
      <li>Hiking</li>
      <li>Phone calls</li>
      <li>Doing things because everyone else does</li>
      <li>Unnecessarily complicated explanations</li>
      <li>C</li>
      <li>Software that takes 20 seconds to start</li>
      <li>Being surrounded by conversation I cannot understand</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>More about me</h2>
    <p>
      I was born deaf, but can hear some sounds. With hearing aids, one-on-one
      conversations are okay, group conversations are impossible. Phone calls
      are impossible. I strongly prefer Discord and internet forums to group
      conversations in real life. I do find social media too performative for my
      tastes, but I participate in it every once in a while.
    </p>

    <p>
      Despite being born deaf, I was raised orally without sign language for
      some reason, so I spent my whole life developing my ability to understand
      and guess spoken English, but even at best, understanding speech is a
      slog, especially in groups. My reading skill is much better, and reading
      takes far less mental effort than listening.
    </p>

    <p>
      I have a PhD in mathematics, though I like understanding mathematical
      structures more than producing theorems.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
